HST Office: its own SharePoint support class, type library and ProgID.

spsupp_x86/x64.dll registered LibreOffice's LOSPSupport.OpenDocuments ProgID, class id
{F1924D0C-9B35-4A46-BCDE-CFEF2CE67A17} and type library {580411ED-80EC-4834-BA1F-2EB07A49C80B},
so installing or removing either suite replaced or deleted the other's registration.

- Class id {28290BF3-5BD8-46EB-8DE2-F579F43C84F5} (also the coclass id in the type library),
  type library {4911128C-9CD7-417C-A187-792464493057}, ProgIDs HSTOffice.SPSupport.OpenDocuments
  and .1 to .5. Generated once for HST Office and never changed.
- The interfaces keep Microsoft's ids (IOWSNewDocument*): SharePoint calls them.
- The optional "replace the Office SharePoint handler" feature still points Microsoft's
  SharePoint.OpenDocuments at the HST class, as it is meant to.
- The start-up error message names HST Office, in Vietnamese.

License: modified upstream files keep their license (MPL-2.0).

